        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 224.07,
          "end": 226.07999999999998,
          "en": "except for the default look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 226.07999999999998,
          "end": 228.297,
          "en": "But with that, we now have this flat look,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 228.297,
          "end": 230.93,
          "en": "this hopefully also gives you an idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 230.93,
          "end": 233.25,
          "en": "of what you can do with components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 233.25,
          "end": 237.06,
          "en": "We now are building a button which can easily be configured",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.06,
          "end": 240.92,
          "en": "through some props, through some attributes you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 240.92,
          "end": 244.04,
          "en": "and we don't need to write complex styling here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 244.04,
          "end": 246.97,
          "en": "Instead, the styling is all inside of the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 246.97,
          "end": 249.86,
          "en": "and whoever then uses our buttoning code",
