        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 252.62,
          "end": 255.86,
          "en": "If you were working on a bigger project, in a bigger team,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 255.86,
          "end": 259.63,
          "en": "writing components like this, of course is super powerful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.63,
          "end": 262.77,
          "en": "because just one person needs to create the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 262.77,
          "end": 266.24,
          "en": "and the styling, and then the entire team can use it",
