          "en": "So through attributes in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 271.52,
          "end": 274.19,
          "en": "That's also why I'm showing you something like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 274.19,
          "end": 276.76,
          "en": "in this course, because you need to be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 276.76,
